{"type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`compare_versions` was comparing full version strings with `<` / `>`, so `\"1.10.0\"` sorted before `\"1.9.0\"` because `\"1.1…\"` is lexicographically less than `\"1.9…\"`.\n\nIt now splits on `.`, parses each segment as an integer, pads shorter tuples with trailing `0`s (so `1.10` vs `1.9.0` align as `1.10.0` vs `1.9.0`), and compares component by component. That fixes double-digit minors/patches and keeps `semver_summary` in `repo/rows.py` correct.\n\n`old_compare_versions` still delegates to `compare_versions`; nothing else in the repo imports it. Both visible semver tests pass."}]},"session_id":"9ba15a90-8db0-4761-b74c-82b25fab6a08"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","duration_ms":117609,"duration_api_ms":117609,"is_error":false,"result":"Inspecting `version.py` and how version comparison is used across the repo.\nFixing lexical string comparison: implement numeric per-component comparison.\n`compare_versions` was comparing full version strings with `<` / `>`, so `\"1.10.0\"` sorted before `\"1.9.0\"` because `\"1.1…\"` is lexicographically less than `\"1.9…\"`.\n\nIt now splits on `.`, parses each segment as an integer, pads shorter tuples with trailing `0`s (so `1.10` vs `1.9.0` align as `1.10.0` vs `1.9.0`), and compares component by component. That fixes double-digit minors/patches and keeps `semver_summary` in `repo/rows.py` correct.\n\n`old_compare_versions` still delegates to `compare_versions`; nothing else in the repo imports it. Both visible semver tests pass.","session_id":"9ba15a90-8db0-4761-b74c-82b25fab6a08","request_id":"17f591be-3a84-406b-a7d1-8053c104f7ea","usage":{"inputTokens":12856,"outputTokens":1763,"cacheReadTokens":77507,"cacheWriteTokens":0}}
